cmn4elix00000j0s3691q4f98	cmn4el9es0000j0s3m8dwa0o6	SUMMARY\nComputer Science undergraduate specializing in full-stack development with expertise in Node.js,\nExpress, React, and Next.js. Experienced in building scalable RESTful APIs, implementing\nauthentication, and integrating cloud storage solutions with MongoDB and PostgreSQL. Focused on\nwriting clean, maintainable code with strong emphasis on performance optimization and system\ndesign.\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\nLanguages: JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript  \nFrontend: Next.js, React, TailwindCSS, HTML5, CSS3  \nBackend: Node.js, Express  \nDatabases: MongoDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL\nTools: Git, GitHub, Postman\nGithub \nDHRUV SABHARWAL\n (+91) 8920086657 | dhruvsabharwalh7@gmail.com\nLinkedIN\nRELEVANT PROJECTS\nBuilt RESTful APIs using Node.js and Express for core functionalities like video upload, user auth,\nand comments.\nDesigned separate MongoDB schemas for users, videos, likes, subscription, playlist, and\ncomments to ensure scalable and organised data modelling.	[-0.0015680834,0.0037515948,0.004653481,-0.065059446,-0.023669552,0.018043386,0.040116876,0.00058179937,-0.0051044426,-0.006606081,-0.00023082629,-0.008455684,0.008664917,0.040060643,0.12236149,0.0066407155,0.004755497,-0.0094846785,0.005101427,-0.013357159,0.00957801,0.016084662,0.021105403,-0.019349381,-0.0065116403,0.0009524184,0.0068568126,0.009799744,0.044397593,0.0067833094,0.01323741,-0.0063572912,-0.010840711,0.028695973,-0.024190776,-0.013906958,0.023902591,-0.0016113712,-0.013301112,0.015785586,-0.016196772,0.032893445,-0.01857504,-0.011425266,-0.021652622,-0.010700736,0.009683021,0.004964144,-0.023407308,0.018907623,0.0021444517,-0.022889266,-0.027873335,-0.18575624,-0.005538132,0.018635686,-0.014303891,-0.0073176203,0.023600468,-0.01789165,0.006604848,0.015144374,-0.024392249,-0.00025934228,0.007560823,-0.00605483,0.020384707,0.009119242,-0.014109201,0.0050235353,-0.01033241,0.0057429858,-0.018022105,-0.013928957,-0.0046766265,-0.008676006,0.0120