cmnf550ux0001uxs3get1eyzg	cmnf54v1q0000uxs3xvdto6zl	fleeting desires, basic human aspirations represent what we genuinely seek for a\nmeaningful and fulfilled life.\nThe primary human aspirations can be understood in a hierarchical framework. At\nthe foundation is the aspiration for security and safety—the need to ensure our\nphysical well-being and create a stable foundation for existence. Building upon\nthis is the aspiration for growth and development, where we seek to enhance our\ncapabilities, knowledge, and potential. The aspiration for connection and\nbelonging reflects our need to form meaningful relationships and be part of\ncommunities. Finally, at the highest level is the aspiration for meaning and\npurpose—the search for understanding why we exist and what our life should\ncontribute to the larger whole.\nImportantly, these aspirations are universal. Whether someone is wealthy or poor,\neducated or illiterate, living in an urban metropolis or a remote village, all humans	[-0.0044818823,0.003922475,0.009194015,-0.06484675,-0.00026466057,0.027388936,0.0037108026,0.005952297,0.013790794,-0.008417606,0.016326701,-0.0076682204,-0.0047579487,0.02928001,0.1332556,0.006342302,0.008457172,0.006922571,0.025303587,0.0068525984,0.005613424,-0.0013077068,-0.0046404763,-0.0147675155,-0.013465603,0.018082775,-0.00054042594,0.024845673,-0.003054081,-0.0071573183,0.0008354767,0.016888052,0.007895867,0.032426253,-0.014742555,0.007628862,0.02923831,-0.015318306,0.0065277494,-0.0058385646,0.00081197795,-0.009453451,-0.0120264515,-0.018370923,0.009616889,-0.0062941536,0.0018646313,0.00325514,-0.0084490385,0.00064989144,-0.0069098896,0.009379592,-0.0033953222,-0.23394817,0.005657862,-0.02336436,0.0025233617,-0.0121281305,0.008288681,-0.007333126,-0.015523581,0.008131276,0.002609907,-0.0014921243,0.0073167714,-0.0067738327,0.024754185,0.014553122,-0.010127488,0.013147902,-0.010008148,0.011630605,0.0011323779,-0.014764838,0.0037069777,0.018713498,-0.0057800724,-0.000694787,-0.0