cmnf551su0003uxs3bbm9d9mb	cmnf54v1q0000uxs3xvdto6zl	All-encompassing Resolution and Fulfillment of Aspirations\nAn all-encompassing resolution represents a unified, comprehensive commitment\nto a way of living that simultaneously addresses all basic human aspirations.\nRather than pursuing fragmented goals that may contradict each other, an all-\nencompassing resolution integrates our various aspirations into a coherent whole.\nThe key to understanding this concept lies in recognizing that human\ndissatisfaction often arises not from external circumstances but from internal\nfragmentation. We pursue success while compromising relationships. We seek\npleasure while neglecting growth. We chase security through harmful means.\nThese contradictions create internal disharmony even when we achieve our\nindividual goals.\nAn all-encompassing resolution transcends these contradictions by establishing a\nunified direction for life. For instance, a resolution centered on "living with	[0.0028314996,-0.013540067,0.010751092,-0.05687347,0.0058786534,0.014303892,0.009148983,0.016549084,0.011770015,-0.02349964,0.004557626,-0.012241582,-0.0018930387,0.030067274,0.12509482,0.012101078,0.0104756635,0.0045154765,0.010837452,0.0052216863,0.009248428,0.005378068,0.0058158296,-0.016731054,-0.010300402,0.018862415,0.004432984,0.026019238,0.018974693,-6.506911e-05,-0.012737732,0.03381,0.013518492,0.03859476,8.1712795e-05,0.008049724,0.015756587,-0.01102537,0.011363246,0.0006929833,-0.007940071,0.015714074,0.010439931,-0.016776161,0.0083233435,-0.002443811,-0.011340414,-0.026871255,-0.0027845907,-3.3228727e-05,-0.021171698,0.0036814255,-0.026479214,-0.22409149,0.011956865,-0.012150386,0.010323567,0.006318858,-0.000801392,-0.0032869284,-0.0044187433,0.0073909126,-0.006172163,-0.0008498584,0.00947363,-0.027627112,0.021501834,0.008946576,-0.016407436,-0.004457053,-0.016402366,0.008475795,-0.0027288208,-0.0032996389,0.008611157,0.002859495,-0.011754198,-0.0049839355,0.0024048039,-0.014070089,-0