cmnf5529w0004uxs3gifu4epz	cmnf54v1q0000uxs3xvdto6zl	individual goals.\nAn all-encompassing resolution transcends these contradictions by establishing a\nunified direction for life. For instance, a resolution centered on "living with\nhonesty and considering the well-being of all" naturally fulfills multiple aspirations\nsimultaneously. Through honest living, we secure genuine relationships\n(connection), develop integrity (growth), build authentic self-respect (meaning),\nand create a life based on genuine values rather than fear (security). This\nresolution is "all-encompassing" because it doesn't address each aspiration\nseparately but weaves them together into one coherent commitment.\nThe resolution acts as a filter through which all decisions can be made. When\nfaced with choices, we ask: "Does this align with my all-encompassing resolution?"\nThis eliminates the paralysis of conflicting desires and creates clarity. Importantly,\nsuch a resolution is not imposed through force of will but emerges from genuine	[0.0019864915,-0.01226594,0.0071083386,-0.05762579,0.0094029475,0.017078664,0.009517497,-0.003148981,0.011693349,-0.02825205,0.008468229,-0.0063544824,0.008336131,0.030022921,0.11483077,-0.0018951967,0.01341295,0.014221296,0.0103973085,-0.0007551569,0.011456271,0.002500054,0.004569609,-0.00445469,-0.005386946,0.0019525117,0.0013801769,0.014958802,0.03176659,-0.0038098546,-0.0052868533,0.031342957,0.004639652,0.04144083,-0.007600615,0.0008882253,0.018423343,-0.017908119,0.0055821543,-0.0142838685,-0.01150609,0.0065017175,0.002496155,-0.017686032,0.0037374706,-0.00699265,0.0016242445,-0.013700753,-0.011777467,0.0053330166,-0.029084913,-0.0007935321,-0.022585036,-0.20090313,0.011753548,-0.013388326,0.010986287,-0.00032738398,0.003455594,0.0030491902,-0.01813683,-0.0016063849,-0.010979634,-0.011549109,0.013438048,-0.021594577,0.036889818,0.006109275,-0.020130014,0.002579955,-0.010792142,0.0001075042,-0.019208053,-0.01857829,0.013369686,0.0016472085,-0.000793079