cmnf554670007uxs38m108gcx	cmnf54v1q0000uxs3xvdto6zl	If we genuinely understand that harming others ultimately harms ourselves\n(through guilt, broken relationships, and social consequences), we don't need to\nforce ourselves to be ethical—it becomes a natural choice.\nTogether, right understanding and right resolution create the conditions for\nharmony. Understanding provides the vision, while resolution provides the\ncommitment to live according to that vision. Without understanding, resolution\nbecomes rigid dogmatism. Without resolution, understanding remains mere\nintellectual knowledge without practical impact.\nAchieving Harmony in Human Life\nHarmony in human life emerges when understanding, resolution, and action are\nperfectly aligned. This harmony operates at multiple levels simultaneously.\nAt the individual level, harmony means internal integration—where our thoughts,\nemotions, and actions are unified toward genuine fulfillment rather than\nfragmented across conflicting desires. When we hold an all-encompassing	[-0.0030932361,-0.028238738,0.016368518,-0.055822402,-0.0013013537,0.011434394,0.009862557,0.008584106,0.0005017566,-0.009098189,0.009109063,-0.00026865472,-0.0064311307,0.01704132,0.10899582,0.0068943133,0.006385371,-0.0004819554,0.0143775,-0.014432838,0.021083012,0.019677065,0.011918894,-0.0115014715,-0.017438978,0.022673778,-0.0040548574,0.01518231,0.024517436,-0.018346699,0.0033089435,0.020404872,0.018381463,0.040778022,0.0047797393,0.0023889968,-0.004861926,-0.0048705884,-0.014789229,-0.0021487786,-0.0046306304,0.03086082,-0.0020233132,-0.0064583006,0.006491835,0.006826526,0.0037759447,-0.020131135,-0.016809694,-0.0032207714,-0.022197004,0.014358475,-0.01614112,-0.21909405,0.0071240114,-0.017930739,-0.009087928,-0.014237751,-0.004906786,0.0037313127,-0.0046512294,0.007946402,-0.004491812,-0.011871531,-0.0030412895,-0.017978765,0.02780229,0.008809954,-0.007006227,0.0019930564,-0.010314299,-3.597292e-06,-0.012704315,-0.00345587,0.011196396,-0.