cmnf554nb0008uxs3gv1g20qi	cmnf54v1q0000uxs3xvdto6zl	emotions, and actions are unified toward genuine fulfillment rather than\nfragmented across conflicting desires. When we hold an all-encompassing\nresolution grounded in right understanding, we experience psychological\nwholeness and peace.\nAt the relational level, this harmony extends to our relationships with others.\nWhen our resolution is to genuinely care for others' well-being (not merely use\nthem for our purposes), and when this flows from understanding our\ninterdependence, our relationships become authentic and nourishing. This\nnaturally fulfills our aspirations for connection.\nAt the social level, when individuals live with right understanding and right\nresolution, society itself becomes more harmonious. Trust increases, cooperation\nreplaces competition, and collective well-being becomes the natural outcome of\nindividual choices.\nThe pathway to this harmony is clear: Right Understanding → Right Resolution →	[0.0037373232,-0.023874838,0.009178692,-0.06591622,0.0045689302,0.016314551,0.0037341316,0.012771967,0.012370134,-0.01728833,0.03192132,0.0024525349,-0.0013143702,0.03292804,0.11375887,0.0058991793,0.008379803,0.0009603021,0.018851232,-0.0041991025,0.024794206,0.02269407,0.0037635823,-0.010737867,-0.0020092097,0.023793865,0.0072877263,0.022153676,0.036731586,-0.016884,0.004921102,0.034027033,0.018700626,0.036266547,0.008541198,0.00036306636,-0.002077213,-0.002354816,-0.015940798,-0.0075739278,0.005787958,0.025395103,0.0034135375,-0.008788798,0.015415166,0.00215706,0.007434653,-0.009262701,-0.014465894,-0.008975984,-0.024184814,0.017411418,-0.021390965,-0.20716168,0.008027998,-0.015661936,-0.0007069156,-0.005772514,0.0013111959,0.0031741299,-0.00689405,0.012661391,-0.013509493,0.0023322126,0.011746968,-0.014022553,0.020806614,0.0028564255,-0.008395253,0.0032531384,-0.0035513535,0.006117536,-0.011264087,-0.0007980969,0.02236112,-0.0053998507,-0.014915899,0.00013508693,-0.0031384556,-0.0060618515,