cmnf5wvxa0010uxs3hdca5xya	cmnf5wccs0003uxs3mc5evhul	factorial(). Another file imports it with import math_utils and uses math_utils.add(3, 4).\nPackages\nA package is a collection of related modules organized in a hierarchical directory structure.\nPackages provide a higher level of organization and prevent naming conflicts across large projects.\nIn Python, a directory containing an __init__.py file constitutes a package. In Java, packages are\ndeclared at the top of files with package com.company.project;.\nBenefits of Modules and Packages: They enable large-scale software development by breaking\ncode into manageable units, support independent development and testing of components, allow\ncontrolled visibility (public vs. private interfaces), and facilitate code reuse across different projects\nby distributing packages (e.g., npm, pip).\nQ17. What are abstract data types (ADT)? Explain with example.\nAn Abstract Data Type (ADT) is a mathematical model for a data type defined by its behavior	[0.0010421551,-0.011746154,0.017289761,-0.055238944,-0.025283027,0.010667685,0.02994305,0.010312745,0.0140929725,-0.0067688655,-0.0059431097,-0.0014879542,-0.0027210242,0.0072381566,0.12496971,0.004519451,-1.7878408e-05,-0.010223348,0.01654001,-0.03802004,0.016123675,0.004336747,-0.005055355,-0.029407134,-0.0012430508,-0.009451751,0.0029473656,0.00342817,0.049149435,-0.0010480074,-0.012396245,0.025732532,-0.0016106036,0.012382684,-0.0027158323,-0.0035953932,-0.016208572,0.002214522,0.005205349,0.007911083,-0.01592468,0.0023144789,0.005475893,-0.005785054,0.005149001,0.0032324335,0.0106650675,-0.016513517,-0.028319607,0.014248683,0.016472038,-0.010852789,-0.0032077911,-0.19479105,0.024865732,0.0011235694,-0.0075363414,0.012778154,0.007836237,0.0022340862,0.0033100885,0.006558672,-0.017964168,0.006800906,0.0061517092,-0.025555886,0.030088706,-0.015537224,-0.018830124,0.0010969075,0.01788336,-0.0047308416,-0.011197032,-0.019519303,0.017331505,-0.0055713183,0.025444398,-0.02367198