cmnf5x0r20019uxs39rq96oza	cmnf5wccs0003uxs3mc5evhul	6. Better Encapsulation: Bundling data with operations that act on it, and restricting access, leads\nto objects that are self-managing. This models real-world entities more naturally.\n7. Parallel Development: Multiple teams can work on different modules simultaneously without\ninterfering with each other, as long as they agree on the interfaces. This accelerates development in\nlarge projects.\n8. Easier Debugging: When a bug exists, information hiding localizes the potential source — if a\ndata error occurs, it must originate within the module that controls that data, greatly narrowing the\nsearch space.\nGood luck on your exam! — Principles of Programming Languages Answer Guide	[-0.015856652,-0.007641013,0.0063039367,-0.0601752,0.010978341,-4.2679978e-05,0.008496427,0.029575497,0.017540343,-0.014784613,-0.00045476807,-0.007207541,-0.009405677,0.003293201,0.11307368,0.020730954,-0.0021152445,-0.007488579,0.0074400925,0.004706644,0.00067671295,0.019331232,-0.001901447,-0.020159742,0.0077777305,0.0034826247,0.03177099,0.008362712,0.050597828,-0.00040861344,-0.015110522,0.048390523,0.030005448,0.026842663,0.0074829636,-0.00050405506,-0.0017289141,0.0010342974,-0.011352848,-0.005599967,-0.010784758,-0.0029866046,0.0027903828,0.025147328,-0.0015268347,0.03165515,-0.006094715,-0.0062218597,-0.030514969,0.024946986,0.02510822,-0.014168298,-0.0026888035,-0.17350203,0.030859077,-0.013063682,0.014133673,0.0074552204,-0.0026825015,0.0038157266,-0.007560866,0.012749843,-0.015022977,0.012417298,0.013846009,-0.02388399,0.001323958,-0.0072103557,-0.014772654,0.009964023,0.003348673,0.02130523,-0.0023279246,0.0038852731,0.033255916,-0.00074561394,0.0052439305,-0.007271469,0.0063054585,-0.00045531653,-0.035740882,-0.01688403,0.0034675624,-0.017451063,-0.019406214,-0.0015209027,-0.014585892,-0.0024553288,-0.021879194,-0.0008796905,0.0044036605,0.01899706,-0.006710083,0.012220654,0.03398101,0.0097339135,-0.01450934,0.009647643,-0.